1
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,656
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,536
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,656
=Episode 22=

4
00:00:47,679 --> 00:00:48,359
Find out

5
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,159
who leaked this.

6
00:00:50,159 --> 00:00:50,679
(Yes.)

7
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:52,280
(Should we calm the rumors?)

8
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:52,799
No.

9
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,200
Make it worse.

10
00:00:57,399 --> 00:00:58,960
(Zhang Haotian.)

11
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:02,159
(It's time we settled our score.)

12
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,880
(The kidney your mother received)

13
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,719
(was taken from a girl)

14
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:06,640
(named Jiang Lai.)

15
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:09,319
(Your husband, Zhang Haotian,
deceived her with love.)

16
00:01:09,599 --> 00:01:10,239
Baby,

17
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,079
who made you upset?

18
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:16,200
Two years ago, my mom was diagnosed
with kidney failure.

19
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,560
But recently,

20
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,480
our family doctor

21
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,439
searched the database

22
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:21,760
and found a perfectly matched kidney.

23
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,719
She refused to donate, no matter
how much we offered.

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,879
It's driving me crazy.

25
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,719
Can I see it?

26
00:01:31,719 --> 00:01:33,640
(Kidney Function Test: Jiang Lai)
(I don't like Zhao Ke,)

27
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:36,599
(but I did want to know
what really happened.)

28
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:39,840
(Prenuptial Agreement)
(When I used my own life as leverage)

29
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,680
(and got the prenuptial agreement,)

30
00:01:42,319 --> 00:01:44,640
(I found out Mom had set up
a trust fund.)

31
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,120
(Trust Fund Agreement)
(I was furious at the time.)

32
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,680
(I thought my mom kept placing)

33
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,079
(more and more restraints on Haotian.)

34
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:54,079
(It was seriously
affecting our marriage.)

35
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:57,400
(So I contacted the trustee.)

36
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,359
(Lulu.)

37
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,280
(Setting up the trust)

38
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,040
(was a desperate measure Ms. Su
took to protect you.)

39
00:02:03,599 --> 00:02:05,159
(After my mom passed away,)

40
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:07,519
(Haotian framed me for cheating)

41
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,120
(to divorce me and split our assets.)

42
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,759
(Why are you here?)

43
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:11,319
(Get away from me!)

44
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,199
(Lulu.)

45
00:02:13,879 --> 00:02:14,800
(Please let me go.)

46
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:16,599
(I opened the safe)

47
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:19,840
(and deliberately let Haotian
see the trust fund.)

48
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:22,039
(I wanted to see his reaction)

49
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:24,120
(when he realized he would get nothing.)

50
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,680
(But it turned out...)

51
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,360
(No surprise at all.)

52
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,599
(We can get divorced right now.)

53
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,319
(I really love you, Lulu.)

54
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,240
(Divorce would hurt me even more.)

55
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,039
(I can't imagine my life without you.)

56
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,960
(Instead of worrying about this,)

57
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,520
(you should look into)

58
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,759
(the truth)

59
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,639
(behind your mother's death.)

60
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,039
(Your mother's death)

61
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,719
(is connected to Zhang Haotian.)

62
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,159
(Whether Zhang Haotian was responsible)

63
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:49,879
(for my mother's death,)

64
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:51,719
(the police will find out.)

65
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,560
(But right now,)

66
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,800
(I'll use this illegal
fundraising scandal)

67
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,360
(to burn away your disguise.)

68
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,599
(Let me)

69
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:59,800
(be the last victim.)

70
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,479
Dr. Chen, can I have my phone back now?

71
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,240
Jiang Lai.

72
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,000
I don't know what you're talking about.

73
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:17,120
Do you know

74
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:19,520
I could

75
00:03:20,199 --> 00:03:21,000
kill you here as easily

76
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,919
as snapping my fingers?

77
00:03:32,479 --> 00:03:33,240
Mai.

78
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,439
Are you okay?

79
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,400
I'm fine.

80
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,080
Let's go.

81
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,599
Mr. Zhang,

82
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:51,280
I've invested a lot of money in you.

83
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,199
What about the 40% return you promised?

84
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,919
You can't go back on your word.

85
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,319
You're not leaving until you
give us an explanation.

86
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,319
You looked so respectable,

87
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:59,400
but you're nothing but a fraud.

88
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,800
You married Ms. Lin

89
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,520
just to get your hands on her money.

90
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,599
Could he have something to do
with Ms. Su's death?

91
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,960
You believe every rumor you hear.

92
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,560
You're just being used by someone.

93
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,199
Don't you know that?

94
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,759
When will my returns arrive?

95
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,159
I've invested for over two months.

96
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:14,360
And I haven't seen a single cent.

97
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,000
Give us our money back!

98
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,879
Give us our money back!

99
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,480
Investments come with risks.

100
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:20,199
You should all know that.

101
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,160
No returns mean you lost money.

102
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,399
If you want to take legal action,

103
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:24,639
go ahead.

104
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,279
Hello?

105
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:05,560
Hello, baby.

106
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,680
Can you possibly

107
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:10,120
transfer five hundred million
to me first?

108
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,079
Honey,

109
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,279
large transfers

110
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,480
can't possibly arrive in one day.

111
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,240
Okay.

112
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:26,040
(This is bad.)

113
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:27,600
(I'm screwed.)

114
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:35,079
Ke.

115
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:36,560
Come with me.

116
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,399
Chen Ping must have told you.

117
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,800
I'm not Zhao Ke.

118
00:05:39,959 --> 00:05:40,879
I'm Jiang Lai.

119
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,600
You're Zhang Yongren's daughter.

120
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,279
We're family.

121
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,720
We still have a home.

122
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:46,519
A home?

123
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,600
Someone like you doesn't deserve one.

124
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,199
Let's go.

125
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:37,720
Jiang Lai.

126
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:40,959
Jiang Lai.

127
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:51,439
You...

128
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,879
Don't hurt her.

129
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,279
Let go.

130
00:06:58,079 --> 00:06:59,040
Let go.

131
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:01,000
Let go.

132
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:19,060
(Everything Is Exposed)

133
00:07:19,692 --> 00:07:24,590
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

134
00:07:24,876 --> 00:07:28,290
♪I should forget you♪

135
00:07:28,372 --> 00:07:33,220
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

136
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,364
♪To carry on♪

137
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:40,852
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

138
00:07:40,916 --> 00:07:43,330
♪You no longer have the strength♪

139
00:07:44,844 --> 00:07:47,860
♪You want me to go there for you♪

140
00:07:49,356 --> 00:07:54,820
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

141
00:07:55,436 --> 00:07:58,820
♪Your freedom♪

142
00:07:58,876 --> 00:08:03,890
♪Has become my cage♪

143
00:08:04,444 --> 00:08:11,410
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

144
00:08:11,596 --> 00:08:16,960
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

145
00:08:17,756 --> 00:08:23,840
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

146
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:28,812
♪You told me♪

147
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:33,110
♪I would shine like a star♪

148
00:08:33,196 --> 00:08:36,180
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

149
00:08:36,556 --> 00:08:41,270
♪How to live without you♪

150
00:08:41,730 --> 00:08:47,476
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

151
00:08:48,884 --> 00:08:51,980
♪So hazy and blurred♪
